{"server":"en","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-04_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-04","title":"Cracked","storyCode":"3-4","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"c2a9c144c99485e82c619864b685129b96c279355dd6fe094c80837814760516","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"However, the ambush was intended to be a distraction, and everything was to set the stage for a single lethal blow against the Doctor.\nEven though the first hit is blocked, the second flies towards the Doctor, about to find its mark—","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"What the hell..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"All that, for only a single Reunion squad..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"And a really big guy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Now that was the highlight. I'm totally exhausted just from dealing with him!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Impossible."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"How could so many Infected vanish so quickly?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Was that giant guy just a diversion?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Did Reunion manage to completely evacuate this area in such a short period of time?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No... Madam Ch'en should have blocked off their escape route..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not seeing the designated waypoint."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Something... isn't right about this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Weeds, ruins, sand dunes..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"All of which are potential spots for an ambush..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"But, I'm not seeing anything."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"No footsteps, no sounds of clothing brushing against plants, no smell of explosives..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't tell what's going on!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Penguin Logistics, wake up and do your job!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"This isn't right at all!"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Hush!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What's that sound...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"... ... ... Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"It's from... underground?!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! The noise is coming from underground!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"!!!!"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor!! Get down, now!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"These guys... will really stop at nothing!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"...?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"How... did you block that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"My 'Hannya' is not something you can penetrate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll see... about that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"The temperature is rising sharply! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Is he trying to detonate his staff?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor! Run away! At that distance, you'll--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"You'll---"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_lastattack"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's over!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No... Noooo---!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You can't-----"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't let you hurt Doctor------! !"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_reflect"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_underattack"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_lastbreath"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You are powerful..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"But... look at you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You're so strong."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*cough*... It hurts..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Even though you have this kind of power..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You still... in cold blood... watch your fellow Infected..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I can't... forgive..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I can't forgive those like you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"... ..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"No... Don't...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["Misha"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["Hoshiguma"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["Franka","Hoshiguma","Skullshatterer"]}]}
